  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融產業專業實習",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL INDUSTRY INTERNSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "將學校所學的金融知識更能融入金融產業實務中，且期能透過學生至金融產業實習之過程，讓學生早日熟悉產業發展及金融產業經營環境。藉此課程，印證理論與實務結合，並進而在畢業前學習溝通技巧與金融倫理。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to help students understand the practice of financial industry. In the process of financial industry practice, the students will be familiar with the industrial development and financial industry environment. Also, financial industry practice can verify the theory and the practice union, to promote students’ studying effect. The students will learn communication skills and financial ethics required in workplace before graduation.",
    "pre_subname": "FINA4098金融產業專業實習導論",
    "pre_sub_id3": "FINA4098",
    "pre_sub_ename": "FINA4098 INTRODUCTION TO FINANCIAL INDUSTRY INTERNSHIP",
